    dct:description "The prediction is testable after defining intervention classes and outcomes. Current public clinical and preclinical data do not provide controlled head-to-head tests broad enough to resolve the central claim." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: In matched disease models, compare interventions designed as training or high-level state cues against molecular micromanagement for efficacy, durability, adverse effects and complexity. Consistent superiority of behavioural-style protocols would support the therapeutic prediction." ;
